# The fontconfig family names every toolkit config asks for by string.
#
# fc-list family names, not package names: a font can be installed and still not
# be found by fontconfig. Both are bundled under desktop/.local/share/fonts and
# picked up by the post-stow fc-cache run, so neither has an Arch package to
# check in packages.list instead.
#
# One family per line, and the whole line (after any trailing `#` comment) is the
# family name -- a family name may contain spaces, so this file has no flag
# column and never will. Blank lines are ignored; `#` starts a comment.

Plus Jakarta Sans
Geist Mono
